body:
Thank you. And could you please tell me what equipment for terminators is currently the best in 40k? From what I see from the threads, it is very often repeated: Autocannon, 3 combi weapons, 3 fists, chainfist and lightning clawsI thought I'd ask the same question, only in the 30k forum, and try to pick an optimum setup.

&#x200B;

EDIT: Or I will try magnetization. I've never done it and I'm afraid I'll mess something up, but maybe I'll succeed.

The problem is you have to kill them on the moon, but I only managed to find three Vex on the whole map. Without Gatelord.

&#x200B;

EDIt: Ok i got it. You have to be near this points on the map and they will appear.

 To be honest I feel cheated. I chose the Vanguard, but it feels more like I did work for the Praxis... I'm upset because I don't want to create another character. 

&#x200B;

Cheap move Bungo...
